1. The C code uses `SPX_NAMESPACE(name)` which expands to `SPX_name`. All public C functions that use this macro must have `#[unsafe(no_mangle)]` and `extern "C"` with the FINAL linker symbol name `SPX_name`. Check each header file for which functions use SPX_NAMESPACE.

2. Functions NOT using SPX_NAMESPACE (like crypto_sign_keypair, crypto_sign, etc. in api.h, and randombytes) keep their original names with #[unsafe(no_mangle)] extern "C".

