   - `prf_addr(out, ctx, addr)` -> SPX_prf_addr  
   - `gen_message_random(R, sk_prf, optrand, m, mlen, ctx)` -> SPX_gen_message_random
   - `hash_message(digest, tree, leaf_idx, R, pk, m, mlen, ctx)` -> SPX_hash_message
   - `thash(out, in, inblocks, ctx, addr)` -> SPX_thash

